33:["$","div","f070b371280e",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["Contact. If you email or use a contact form, your message and email address are stored so the conversation can be answered and referred back to."]}]
34:["$","h2","083a6640f2aa",{"className":"text-[145%] [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-[1.2em]","data-text":true,"children":["Who your data is shared with"]}]
35:["$","div","02ce879bccbc",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["Data is shared only with the services needed to run the product: Stripe for payments, GitHub for repository access and discussions, and Resend for transactional and update emails. Each processes data under its own privacy terms. Your data is never sold, rented, or shared for advertising."]}]
36:["$","div","02478b7e4824",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["International transfers. Stripe, GitHub, and Resend are based in the United States, so using the site and buying may involve transferring your data outside the EEA. These providers rely on standard data protection safeguards, such as the European Commission's standard contractual clauses, to protect it."]}]
37:["$","h2","1521042d82e6",{"className":"text-[145%] [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-[1.2em]","data-text":true,"children":["How long it is kept"]}]
38:["$","div","7980b5d588af",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["Purchase and access records are kept for as long as you hold a license, plus the period required by tax and accounting law. Mailing list entries are kept until you unsubscribe. Contact messages are kept only as long as useful for support. You can ask for your data to be deleted at any time, subject to records that must be retained by law."]}]
39:["$","h2","66cf8a019f96",{"className":"text-[145%] [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-[1.2em]","data-text":true,"children":["Your rights"]}]
3a:["$","div","ea171976fe67",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["Under the GDPR you can request access to your data, correction, deletion, or a copy in portable form, and you can object to certain processing or withdraw consent at any time. To exercise any of these, email ",["$","$L31","bd14fc686e68",{"href":"mailto:hello@edoardolunardi.dev","className":"underline decoration-from-font decoration-dashed underline-offset-3","children":["hello@edoardolunardi.dev"]}],". You also have the right to complain to your local data protection authority."]}]
3b:["$","h2","d6c3b93cb9af",{"className":"text-[145%] [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-[1.2em]","data-text":true,"children":["Changes to this policy"]}]
3c:["$","div","d3bb99950ec4",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["If this policy changes, the date at the top is updated. Material changes affecting existing buyers will be communicated by email."]}]
40:["$","$L30",null,{"animationDelay":0.1,"as":"div","splitSelector":"[data-text]","className":"flex w-full flex-col gap-[1em] [&_[data-text]>*:not(:first-child)]:indent-0 text-body-10","children":[["$","div","70d2fdd58bc8",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["I use this on every project. I am the heaviest user. The bug I find on a Friday client engagement is the patch you get on Monday."]}],["$","div","abb4e9ff6dae",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["I am one person, not a team. That is a feature. The architecture is consistent because one mind held it from the first schema file to the last revalidation hook. Nobody overrode the opinion. Nobody added a field because a stakeholder asked nicely."]}],["$","div","connbeat01",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["There is no distance between me and this. The decisions in the repo are the ones I make on paid work, in the same week, under the same deadline. When you open the fetch layer or the page builder, you are reading how I actually ship, not a demo cleaned up for sale. That is the whole relationship: you get the thing I rely on, maintained by the person who relies on it most."]}],["$","div","e0caa421f1df",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["I am not trying to turn this into a SaaS. There is no dashboard, no seat-based pricing, no telemetry. The roadmap is not fixed in stone either, it grows out of real client work: when a project turns up something worth having, it becomes part of the product. You buy the repo, you own the repo. I maintain it because I use it too."]}],["$","div","abed4fe4badb",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["Maintaining this in public is a forcing function for my own work. With paying users on both repos, I cannot let the schema rot, skip a Next.js or Astro major, or sit on a breaking change in a Sanity plugin. The same discipline is why an agent is useful on it: the calls are already made and written down, so it builds inside them instead of guessing. Your projects stay current because mine have to."]}]]}]
41:["$","section","e26317c308c6",{"id":"who-am-i","className":"flex flex-col gap-16 pb-64 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-mono text-caption-20 uppercase","children":["$","$L30",null,{"children":["003"," / ","WHO AM I"]}]}],["$","$L30",null,{"animationDelay":0.1,"as":"div","splitSelector":"[data-text]","className":"flex w-full flex-col gap-[1em] [&_[data-text]>*:not(:first-child)]:indent-0 text-body-10","children":[["$","div","90536670937d",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["I am Edo ",["$","$L4c","5960a7c36d4d",{"image":{"_id":"image-db451abc27a16f698305dcb56ec920d5a9dc08c8-1566x1566-jpg","_rev":"fWX29cmQ00AYAU8uIyf37j","altText":"Man in black turtleneck smiling and looking to the side indoors","crop":null,"description":null,"dimensions":{"_type":"sanity.imageDimensions","aspectRatio":1,"height":1566,"width":1566},"hotspot":null,"lqip":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","title":null},"aspectRatio":1,"width":100,"className":"inline-flex h-[1em] w-auto translate-y-[-0.1em] align-middle"}]," - Creative Web Engineer, nearly a decade in. Sanity Pioneer 2026, Awwwards jury member, recognized across Awwwards, CSSDA, and FWA. I have shipped for Buck, Disney, Porsche, Red Bull, Le Labo Fragrances, Getty. Design sensibility, technical depth, obsessive about detail. Based in Vienna, working worldwide."]}],["$","figure","505246234a4e",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-16","data-rich-text-block":"mediaBlock","children":[["$","$L4d",null,{"video":{"_id":"558f8bea-d862-4b32-ad6c-4484e63e645e","_rev":"a5LeVtXGopd0TFR4TufkxV","dimensions":{"aspectRatio":1.7777777777777777,"height":2160,"width":3840},"duration":78.476,"playbackId":"GEAvJNkNURFGORLe01pSIREO7Egh7TtACZclFBXQ9LoE","thumbTime":1},"animatedThumbnail":{"enabled":false,"end":5,"start":0},"loop":true,"autoPlay":true,"aspectRatio":1.7777777777777777,"className":"rounded-8","muted":true,"noControls":false}],null]}],["$","div","9db9e9e72a96",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"chi